T1  -  Evaluation of the Safety and Efficacy of Ganga Water-Phage Therapy Plus Standard Medical Therapy Compared to Standard Medical Therapy Alone for Helicobacter pylori-Related Dyspepsia: a Randomized Controlled Trial
